// DEC-015 (research/028 PR2): the same rule for a top-level FUNCTION. This
// case used to be reported by the duplicate-function check (the builtin symbol
// looked like a second `print`), which named the wrong rule; the builtin-name
// check now runs first, in the first pass, and reports exactly this once.
